      "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
      "label": "User projected onto the speaker of the joke (the man)",
      "description": "The user is projected onto the man in the image, who is visually mapped as the speaker ('i') in the textual joke 'so i gave her diabeetus'. The man's presence and expression serve as the visual representation of the narrator performing the action described in the text, creating an analogical mapping where the viewer identifies with or projects themselves onto the speaker.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
